    "nextcloud": {
      "app_readme": "<h1>Nextcloud</h1> <p><a href=\"https://nextcloud.com/\">Nextcloud</a> is a file sharing server that puts the control and security of your own data back into your hands.</p> <p>This Community package pins the maintained Nextcloud 34 line and uses immutable container digests. Optional HaRP, notify-push, Talk, recording, Imaginary, PostgreSQL, Valkey and Nginx services are managed as one application while retaining separate persistent storage and secret inputs.</p> <!-- x-readme:warnings:start -->  <p>⚠️ <strong>WARNING:</strong> This app has access to the Docker socket, which gives it full control over all containers and effectively root access to the system.</p> <p>Misconfiguration or a malicious update can compromise data integrity, security, or system stability. Install at your own risk.</p> <!-- x-readme:warnings:end -->",
